# {{ service_name }}

A local Pokerlost FastAPI foundation. It provides health, canonical root/OpenAPI infrastructure, and fail-closed authorization support; no business operation is implemented.

## 🚀 Run

Python 3.14+ and access to the pinned private `pypokerlost` source are required to install. The installed wheel includes the SDK as a runtime dependency; it does not need an adjacent checkout. No database URL or outbound credential is needed for this default render.

```bash
uv lock
uv sync --locked
uv run --locked uvicorn {{ packageName }}.app:create_app --factory --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

`GET /` uses `PokerlostResponse[None]`; `GET /getOpenApi` returns the unmodified OpenAPI document. `/health/live` and `/health/ready` are infrastructure probes. Read `SERVICE.md` for this service's data boundary, [architecture](docs/architecture.md) for the foundation lifecycle, and `AGENTS.md` for local work rules. {% if withTesting %}Run `uv run --locked pytest` for the generated technical suite.{% endif %} {% if withCi %}CI checks source without a secret on PRs; a private SDK build requires a reviewed SHA and an approved, narrowly scoped App installation.{% endif %}
